### 1. Valid XML — expect 200, imported=2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/xml
Content-Type: application/xml

< ./samples/tags-valid.xml

### 2. XML missing name — expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/xml
Content-Type: application/xml

< ./samples/tags-invalid-missing-name.xml

### 3. XML bad color + empty name — expect 400 with TWO errors
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/xml
Content-Type: application/xml

< ./samples/tags-invalid-bad-color.xml

### 4. Valid JSON — expect 200, imported=2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/json
Content-Type: application/json

< ./samples/tags-valid.json

### 5. JSON bad color — expect 400, location /tags/0/color
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/json
Content-Type: application/json

< ./samples/tags-invalid-bad-color.json

### 6. JSON typo'd field — expect 400 with TWO errors
POST http://localhost:8080/api/import/json
Content-Type: application/json

< ./samples/tags-invalid-extra-field.json